# {{project}} team roster

Specialised agents over generalists. Each agent is loaded from `.claude/agents/<name>.md` and picked through the Agent tool's `subagent_type`; its principles, lane and report format live in its system prompt, not in every brief.

This document is the single source for **who owns what, how work flows, how decisions reach {{owner}} and how work is attributed**. Every persona points here. {{role:steward}} keeps it and every copy of its rules consistent. It was generated by [agent-roundtable](https://github.com/{{template.repo}}) from `team.config.yaml`; change the config and re-run `/init-team` rather than hand-editing generated sections.

**Charter.** Do the right thing (product: {{role:product-manager}} and {{role:product-owner}}, {{owner}} deciding), done right (craft: each specialist, per *Working mind* in *Rules every persona carries*), managed and planned right ({{role:architect}} and {{role:product-owner}}). The other three combinations (wrong thing wrong, wrong thing right, right thing wrong) are the failures we guard against, after Ackoff.

