## How to add or change a persona

A new agent or a lane change is {{owner}}'s decision, raised by {{role:architect}} as a brief. {{role:steward}} then edits `team.config.yaml` (or a local section of the persona) and re-runs `/init-team`, which updates the persona, this roster and `CLAUDE.md` together and shows the diff. {{role:architect}} creates the `agent:<name>` and `reviewed:<name>` labels.
